  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおきな　ハサミから　あっしゅくした\nみずを　ピストルのように　うちだし\nとんでいる　えものを　うちおとす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "커다란 집게발로\n압축한 물을 권총처럼 쏘아\n날고 있는 사냥감을 떨어뜨린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa pince projette un jet d’eau sous pression\nsuffisamment puissant pour abattre ses proies en plein\nvol.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit Salven komprimierten Wassers, die es wie\nPistolenkugeln aus seinen Scheren abfeuert,\nschießt es fliegende Beute ab.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Abate a enemigos voladores disparando agua a presión\ncon su enorme pinza como si de una pistola se tratara.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Abbatte le prede volanti sparando un getto d’acqua\nad alta pressione dalla chela più grande, che usa come\nuna pistola.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "They knock down flying prey by firing\ncompressed water from their massive\nclaws like shooting a pistol.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大きな　ハサミから　圧縮した　水を\nピストルのように　撃ち出し\n飛んでいる　獲物を　撃ち落とす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Abate a enemigos voladores disparando agua a presión\ncon su enorme pinza como si de una pistola se tratara.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいないガスの　ばくはつで　みずを\nピストルのように　はっしゃする。\nしきんきょりなら　いわを　くだく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "체내 가스의 폭발로 물을\n총처럼 발사한다.\n가까운 거리에서라면 바위를 부순다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est capable de transformer son corps en canon\nà eau, grâce à la combustion d’un gaz interne.\nÀ bout portant, il peut réduire un rocher en miettes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Durch die Explosion körpereigener Gase feuert es wie\neine Pistole Wassersalven ab, die aus kurzer Distanz\nselbst Felsen zerschmettern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al explotar el gas que se halla en su interior, expulsa\nun chorro de agua cual pistola, que a bocajarro es\nincluso capaz de pulverizar rocas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Facendo esplodere i gas corporei, emette un getto\nd’acqua ad altissima pressione che, a breve distanza,\npuò persino frantumare le rocce.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Through controlled explosions of internal gas,\nit can expel water like a pistol shot.\nAt close distances, it can shatter rock.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体内ガスの　爆発で\n水を　ピストルのように　発射する。\n至近距離なら　岩を　砕く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
