        "url": "/api/v2/version/26/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ハサミは　ときどき　もげることもあり\nさいせいするまでは　コソコソくらす。\nハサミのなかみは　とてもおいしいよ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "가끔 집게가 떨어지면\n재생할 때까지 몰래 숨어 다닌다.\n집게 속살은 매우 맛있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "鉗子時常會脫落，\n在重新長出前會偷偷摸摸地生活。\n鉗子裡面的肉非常美味。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa pince, à la chair délicieuse, tombe parfois.\nIl se fait alors tout petit et se cache le temps\nqu’elle repousse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Manchmal verliert es seine Scheren. Danach lebt\nes in Zurückgezogenheit, bis sie nachwachsen.\nDas Fleisch im Inneren der Scheren ist köstlich.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En alguna que otra ocasión se le cae la pinza,\ny hasta que le crece de nuevo vive aislado. La\ncarne del interior de las pinzas es deliciosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se capita che gli si stacchi una chela, resta\nnascosto finché non ricresce. La polpa delle sue\nchele è una vera prelibatezza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its claws occasionally fall off, and it keeps a low\nprofile until they grow back. The meat of its\nclaws is so delicious!",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ハサミは　時々　もげることもあり\n再生するまでは　コソコソ暮らす。\nハサミの中身は　とても美味しいよ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "钳子时常会掉落，\n在再生之前，会悄悄地生活。\n钳子里面的肉非常美味哦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
